{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "input": {
    "format": "jsonl",
    "required_fields": [
      "assignment_id",
      "experiment_id",
      "task_id",
      "partition",
      "repetition",
      "sequence",
      "condition_code",
      "prompt",
      "oracle"
    ]
  },
  "output": {
    "format": "jsonl",
    "required_fields": [
      "experiment_id",
      "run_id",
      "task_id",
      "partition",
      "arm_id",
      "repetition",
      "status",
      "outcome",
      "usage",
      "evidence_kind",
      "artifact_digest"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    "执行器没有裁决权，只产生原始观察。",
    "控制器负责 condition_code 到 arm_id 的映射；Candidate 和评委不得读取 blind map。",
    "任何 NOT_RUN、BLOCKED、timeout 或缺失证据不得归一化为 PASS。",
    "结果必须绑定精确制品、模型、运行时、任务和 trace digest。"
  ]
}
